'Corrugator & Converting':['Hot surfaces, steam and contact points identified and guarded','Knife and slitter zones guarded and controlled','Reelstands, splicers and nip points adequately controlled','Cleaning methods prevent water/electrical contact and unsafe airline use','Machine access, lifting tables and stackers controlled'],
